    <!-- How roadside vans work (sheet) -->
    <string name="vans_how_title">Skip your test by driving past a van</string>
    <string name="vans_how_intro">AirCare’s RapidScreen units sit beside on-ramps and roads in white vans or small green boxes. They read the exhaust of cars driving past and match it to registration records.</string>
    <string name="vans_how_two_badge">2</string>
    <string name="vans_how_two">You need two clean readings in the 14 months before your renewal.</string>
    <string name="vans_how_window">Both must come at least 90 days before your renewal month. Renewing in July? Readings from May 1 last year to April 1 count.</string>
    <string name="vans_how_when">Units run on weekdays between 5:30 AM and 7 PM, at sites that change every week. Bad weather can close a site early.</string>
    <string name="vans_how_private">The app can’t see your readings. Waitlight is unofficial and not affiliated with AirCare Colorado.</string>
    <string name="vans_how_page">AirCare’s van page</string>
    <string name="vans_how_done">Got it</string>

